{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "c43c88fe-9591-439f-a8ae-650a9c8368db", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-09T02:14:09Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-136_oral_traditions_syj136-ar-story", "lang": "ko", "locator": "내용, 전설 단락", "pageSha256": "d4c64f45193b7933e1994ed8f839413f2527907d574f50ac701461eff9665764", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0020423", "sourceId": "src-syj136-aks-miryang-arirang", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0020423", "text": "옛날 밀양부사 이모(李某)에게 아랑(阿娘)이라는 딸이 있었다."}
{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "c43c88fe-9591-439f-a8ae-650a9c8368db", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-09T02:14:09Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-136_oral_traditions_syj136-ar-death", "lang": "ko", "locator": "내용, 전설 단락", "pageSha256": "d4c64f45193b7933e1994ed8f839413f2527907d574f50ac701461eff9665764", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0020423", "sourceId": "src-syj136-aks-miryang-arirang", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0020423", "text": "비수로 아랑을 살해하고 숲 속에 묻어버렸다."}
